{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-integral-domain","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0149","math_ordinal":528,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH24-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"Both displayed integrals must be whole-space integrals to prove Definition 246Ab.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt246.tex:643-644","source_normalized_sha256":"d830e7d9b9036784291d597e745e911b561182e41f8e8eda62a70a42077a62f2","source_text":"concluding display uses two \\int_E terms","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt246.tex:641-642","target_normalized_sha256":"29eba0aded2dc3511244e4e2321c8e8fe90596199ab81ae6967656bae1d7cc60","target_text":"concluding display uses whole-space integrals","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
{"classification":"mathematical-invalid-control-measure","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0150","math_ordinal":737,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH24-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The nu_n are signed functionals. A positive common control measure must use total variations; the signed sum can cancel and need not be a measure.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt246.tex:848","source_normalized_sha256":"f613140be411f5d2a0d55a7825286816994c86ef05f14a657959b3b124b8a3d6","source_text":"\\mu=\\sum a_n\\nu_n","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt246.tex:845","target_normalized_sha256":"3944d901d08ca0ef1e085c58061918e884e9cec4d8541149b600baeea00cabf2","target_text":"\\mu=\\sum a_n|\\nu_n|","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S246"}
